<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 5,210 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 6,000 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  141   (270 and 174)</p>
<p>    Good		139   (136 and 140)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     132   (125 and 120)</p>
<p>    Medium	    126   (117 and  98)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	100   ( 95 and  82)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 174 pence for a Tora PD.</p>
</text>
